er mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-accent),var(--color-accent-hover))\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🏠</span></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\" style=\"font-size:15px\">Удалёнка</h5><p class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Работайте из любой точки</p></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 p-4 text-center\" style=\"border-radius:14px\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-accent),var(--color-accent-hover))\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">📖</span></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\" style=\"font-size:15px\">Open-source</h5><p class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Ваш код на GitHub</p></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 p-4 text-center\" style=\"border-radius:14px\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-accent),var(--color-accent-hover))\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">⚡</span></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\" style=\"font-size:15px\">Стек</h5><p class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Vue 3, Vite, TypeScript</p></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 p-4 text-center\" style=\"border-radius:14px\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-3\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-accent),var(--color-accent-hover))\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🤖</span></div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\" style=\"font-size:15px\">AI-first</h5><p class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:12px\">GEO передний край</p></div></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"py-5\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-4 text-center\" style=\"font-size:28px\">Открытые вакансии</h2><div class=\"row justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 mb-3\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"><h4 class=\"fw-bold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:17px\">SEO / GEO-специалист</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.6\">Schema.org, JSON-LD, E-E-A-T. AI-поиск (ChatGPT, Perplexity).</p><p style=\"font-size:12px\">Удалённо · Проектная занятость</p></div><div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 mb-3\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"><h4 class=\"fw-bold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:17px\">Frontend-разработчик (Vue 3 / TS)</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.6\">Vue 3 Composition API, Vite SSG, Bootstrap 5. CI/CD.</p><p style=\"font-size:12px\">Удалённо · Полная занятость</p></div><div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-4\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"><h4 class=\"fw-bold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:17px\">DevOps-инженер</h4><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.6\">Nginx, GitHub Actions, rsync. Безопасность статических сайтов.</p><p style=\"font-size:12px\">Удалённо · Проектная занятость</p></div></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"py-5 text-white text-center\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--color-accent),#6d28d9)\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\" style=\"font-size:28px\">Процесс отбора — 4 шага, решение за 3 дня</h2><div class=\"row g-4 justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-2\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);font-size:22px\">1</div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\">Отклик</h5><p class=\"opacity-85\" style=\"font-size:12px\">info@fonai.ru</p></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-2\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);font-size:22px\">2</div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\">Интервью</h5><p class=\"opacity-85\" style=\"font-size:12px\">30-45 мин</p></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-2\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);font-size:22px\">3</div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\">Тестовое</h5><p class=\"opacity-85\" style=\"font-size:12px\">2-4 часа</p></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 col-lg-3\"><div class=\"rounded-circle d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center mx-auto mb-2\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);font-size:22px\">4</div><h5 class=\"fw-bold\">Оффер</h5><p class=\"opacity-85\" style=\"font-size:12px\">3 дня</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"py-5 text-center text-white\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a0414,#1a0a2e,#2d1060)\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><h2 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\" style=\"font-size:28px\">Откликнуться</h2><p class=\"mb-4 opacity-85 mx-auto\" style=\"max-width:500px;font-size:15px\">Отправьте резюме на info@fonai.ru. Тема: «Вакансия: [позиция]»</p><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-light btn-lg px-5 py-3 fw-bold\" style=\"border-radius:12px\">Написать нам</a></div></section>","raw":false}